{"chapter":{"id":108,"name_simple":"Al-Kawthar","name_arabic":"الكوثر","verses_count":3,"revelation_place":"makkah","translated_name":{"language_name":"english","name":"The Abundance"}},"verses":[{"id":6205,"verse_number":1,"verse_key":"108:1","text_uthmani":" إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","juz_number":30,"page_number":602,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muḥammad], al-Kawthar."},{"resource_id":133,"text":"(நபியே!) நிச்சயமாக நாம் உமக்கு ‘கவ்ஸர்' என்னும் நீர் தடாகத்தை கொடுத்திருக்கிறோம்."}]},{"id":6206,"verse_number":2,"verse_key":"108:2","text_uthmani":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","juz_number":30,"page_number":602,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone]."},{"resource_id":133,"text":"ஆகவே, (அவற்றுக்கு நன்றி செலுத்துவதற்காக) நீர் உமது இறைவனைத் தொழுது, குர்பானி (பலி) கொடுத்து வருவீராக."}]},{"id":6207,"verse_number":3,"verse_key":"108:3","text_uthmani":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","juz_number":30,"page_number":602,"translations":[{"resource_id":20,"text":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off."},{"resource_id":133,"text":"நிச்சயமாக உமது எதிரிதான் சந்ததியற்றவன்."}]}],"pagination":{"total_records":3,"total_pages":1,"current_page":1}}